.TH "RAPTOR-RENDER" 1 "2026-10" "RAPTOR Studio" "RAPTOR Studio Manual"
.SH NAME
raptor\-render \- Render the diagram of MODEL to a PNG file (needs Qt) or, when FILE ends in .svg, to a plain SVG drawing (no Qt needed).
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBraptor render\fR [\-h] \-o FILE.png|FILE.svg [\-\-level LEVEL] [\-\-highlight SELECTOR] [\-\-zoom\-to SELECTOR] [\-\-theme {light,dark}] [\-\-max\-px MAX_PX] [\-\-no\-annotations] MODEL
.SH DESCRIPTION
Render the diagram of MODEL to a PNG file (needs Qt) or, when FILE ends in .svg, to a plain SVG drawing (no Qt needed).
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Options
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fIFILE.png|FILE.svg\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-level\fR \fILEVEL\fR
hierarchy id to draw (0 = top level)
.TP
\fB\-\-highlight\fR \fISELECTOR\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-zoom\-to\fR \fISELECTOR\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-theme\fR \fI{light|dark}\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-max\-px\fR \fIMAX_PX\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-no\-annotations\fR

.SH SEE ALSO
\fBraptor\fR(1)
